{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31393","headline":"秋晚信州推院亲友或责无书即事寄答 · 韩琮","name":"秋晚信州推院亲友或责无书即事寄答","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官信安仁拙，书非叔夜慵。\n谬驰骢马传，难附鲤鱼封。\n万里劳何补，千年运忝逢。\n不量横草力，虚慕入云踪。\n洁水空澄监，持铅亦砺锋。\n月寒深夜桂，霜凛近秋松。\n宪摘无逃魏，冤申得梦冯。\n问狸将挟虎，歼虿敢虞蜂。\n商吹移砧调，春华改镜容。\n归期方畹积，愁思暮山重。\n仙鼠犹惊燕，莎鸡欲变蛩。\n唯应碧湘浦，云落及芙蓉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩琮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}